            "C : adjectif : un adverbe est attendu entre « was » et le participe.",
            "D : nom rare."
          ],
          "example": "She was quickly promoted."
        },
        "en": {
          "rule": "Between the auxiliary and the participle: adverb.",
          "why_wrong": [
            "A: rare noun.",
            "C: adjective: an adverb is expected between 'was' and the participle.",
            "D: rare noun."
          ],
          "example": "She was quickly promoted."
        }
      },
